# Repository topology & packages

> **Code is SSOT** — 结构漂移时与代码同 PR 改本文件。分层矩阵 → [`code-layers.mdc`](code-layers.mdc)；
> 依赖理由与债务 → [`docs/product/src-layering.md`](../../docs/product/src-layering.md)。

## Packages（13 个运行时包 + 文档站）

| Package | Path | Role |
| ------- | ---- | ---- |
| `freeanima` | 仓库根 | 编排（just / scripts / tests / docs）；workspace 根 |
| `@freeanima/shared` | `packages/shared/` | 契约（Zod）/ pg-shapes / rpc-contract / habitat-contract / vault-crypto / 同构工具 |
| `@freeanima/kernel` | `packages/kernel/` | Cordis `Kernel` 视图、logger、config-mechanism、logging |
| `@freeanima/core` | `packages/core/` | drizzle schema+migrations、PG、Redis、config 段、llm/tool/tokenizer/tts/compress |
| `@freeanima/engine` | `packages/engine/` | conversation / turn / goal / pipeline / loop-mechanism |
| `@freeanima/capabilities` | `packages/capabilities/` | memory / tools / connectors / self / outpost / mcp-* / federation / llm-openai |
| `@freeanima/features` | `packages/features/` | 28 个**服务端**特性（26 个路由特性带 `cordis-plugin.ts`；见「特性两态」） |
| `@freeanima/server` | `packages/server/` | 组合根：boot、habitat-api、ports、config 真实现、tls |
| `@freeanima/cli` | `packages/cli/` | `anima` / `anima-client` / `anima-probe` |
| `@freeanima/ui-kit` | `packages/ui-kit/` | 设计系统 |
| `@freeanima/portal-sdk` | `packages/portal-sdk/` | SPA 运行时与数据面 |
| `@freeanima/ui-features` | `packages/ui-features/` | 24 个 **UI** 特性（`ui/<bundle>`） |
| `@freeanima/app-frame` | `packages/app-frame/` | 应用布局 chrome、路由、设置 chrome |
| `@freeanima/portal` | `packages/portal/` | 入口宿主：`app/{web,tauri}` + `extension` |
| `@freeanima/site` | `site/` | Astro/Starlight 文档站 |

## Import prefixes

| Shape | Pattern | Example |
| ----- | ------- | ------- |
| Kernel | `@freeanima/kernel` / `@freeanima/kernel/*` | `kernel/logging` |
| Core | `@freeanima/core/*` | `core/db/schema`, `core/config` |
| Engine | `@freeanima/engine` / `@freeanima/engine/*` | `engine/conversation` |
| Capability | `@freeanima/capabilities/{slug}` | `memory`, `tools`, `outpost` |
| Server feature | `@freeanima/features/{slug}/{domain,habitat,protocol}` | `features/task/habitat/routes` |
| Server / CLI | `@freeanima/server/*`、`@freeanima/cli/{anima,client,probe}/*` | `server/ports` |
| Shared | `@freeanima/shared/{name}` | `shared/rpc-contract`, `shared/pg-shapes`, `shared/util` |
| UI kit / SDK | `@freeanima/ui-kit`、`@freeanima/portal-sdk` | 设计系统 / SPA 运行时 |
| UI feature | `@freeanima/ui-features/{slug}/ui/{bundle}` | `ui-features/task/ui/spa` |
| App frame / entry | `@freeanima/app-frame/*`、`@freeanima/portal/*` | 布局 / `portal/app/web` |

**Deprecated（`check-retired-imports.ts` 会失败）**：`@freeanima/habitat/*`、
`@freeanima/frontend/*`、`@freeanima/client/*`、`@freeanima/platform/*`、`@freeanima/host/*`、
`@freeanima/runtime`、裸 `@freeanima/core`（指包时用 `@freeanima/core/*`）。

## `packages/` map

```
packages/
├── shared/                     # 无 React / 无 drizzle
│   ├── rpc-contract/           # frames + feature-rpc/methods/<slug>.ts（method defs SSOT）
│   ├── habitat-contract/       # method-def / route / registry（含 full.ts）
│   ├── pg-shapes/              # codegen 输出（rows/*.gen.ts）+ 手写 jsonb/entity
│   └── {util,vault-crypto,identity,task,coding,companion-*,tts,llm-usage,...}
├── kernel/{context.ts,logging,config-mechanism,random-*}
├── core/{db/{schema,migrations,pg},config,llm,tool,redis,compress,tokenizer,tts,provider,skill,...}
├── engine/{conversation,turn,goal,pipeline,loop-mechanism}
├── capabilities/{memory,tools,connectors,self,outpost,mcp-client,mcp-server,federation,llm-openai}
├── features/<slug>/{cordis-plugin.ts,domain,habitat,protocol}
├── server/{boot,habitat,habitat-api?,features,service,ports,config,tls,schemas,serve.ts,register-*.ts}
├── cli/{anima,client,probe}
├── ui-kit/{components,composite,form,layout,lib,styles,brand}
├── portal-sdk/
├── ui-features/<slug>/ui/{spa,float}/ + 卫星 {vite.config.ts,build.ts,dist}
├── app-frame/{spa/{features,settings,main},vite,lib}
└── portal/{app/{web,tauri},extension,shared}
```

栖息地管理台 = 服务端 `features/habitat`（RPC/ops 面）+ UI `ui-features/habitat`。
MCP 形态实现在 `capabilities/mcp-server`。

## Module resolution

- TS：`tsconfig.base.json` `paths`（每包一条 `@freeanima/<pkg>` 与 `@freeanima/<pkg>/*`）
- Vite：`packages/app-frame/vite/module-aliases.ts` —— `@freeanima/<pkg>/<sub>` →
  `packages/<pkg>/<sub>`（**单一规则**，无 habitat/frontend 双候选）；`freeanimaResolvePlugin` 走 `enforce: "pre"`
- 运行期（bun）：tsconfig paths + `node_modules/@freeanima/*` workspace 符号链接
  （新增包须同时加进根 `package.json` 依赖，否则 bun 不建链）

## 护栏（`just qa check` 全跑）

- 根 `.oxlintrc.json` SSOT + `overrides`；跨层靠 `freeanima/layer-deps`
- oxlint `freeanima/import-depth` / `layer-deps` / `no-module-globals`；
  `dir-import/dir-import-exists`（`bun-plugin-dir-import`）
- `scripts/check-package-deps.ts`（13 包 DAG + 外部依赖禁令）
- `scripts/check-layer-deps.ts`（全仓 + 相对路径）
- `scripts/check-module-globals.ts`、`scripts/check-boot-plugin-parity.ts`
- `scripts/check-retired-imports.ts`
- 文档站：`cd site && bun run build`（先根 `bun install`）
